// Wallpapers and floors. Each is an item (same id) that changes your room when used inside.
// `block` is what the walls or the floor are built of (content/house/blocks.json5; invisible — the
// rooms kit draws them): `look` is the surface you see (a material and its tint), `wainscot` the
// panelling under a wallpaper.
